<title>MEXICO: Mexico's 28-day interbank TIIE rate climbs.</title>
<headline>Mexico's 28-day interbank TIIE rate climbs.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day Interbank Equilibrium Interest Rate (TIIE) for June 27 was calculated at 23.26 percent, up 32 basis points from its level on Thursday, Banco de Mexico sources said.</p>
<p>The Thursday level was 22.94 percent. Friday's level will be published in the government's Official Gazette.</p>
<p>((-- Elena Vega, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9554))</p>
